{"id":11304,"date":"2023-02-21T08:38:56","date_gmt":"2023-02-21T08:38:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/valentine-spectroscopy-timegate-seminar-in-florence\/"},"modified":"2023-02-21T08:38:56","modified_gmt":"2023-02-21T08:38:56","slug":"valentine-spectroscopy-timegate-seminar-in-florence","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/valentine-spectroscopy-timegate-seminar-in-florence\/","title":{"rendered":"Valentine Spectroscopy: Timegate Seminar in Florence"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Dear customers! As the first novelty of this year we would like to present to you a seminar of the Finnish company Timegate, which we are newly representing in the Czech Republic. This emerging company supplies both scientific and industry Raman spectrometers, <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/timegate-ramanovy-spektrometry-s-realnym-potlacenim-fluorescence\/\"><strong>the first integrated systems with really suppressed fluorescence<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>At the seminar, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.timegate.com\/news\/timegated-raman-seminar?utm_campaign=Newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsmi=242338171&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-8VPo_X88-nbr4xMwTJb75oMVf1Pb3CVzfxN8DU9UpHX9knikt9BZi1jD-qfL6RSA3IfvH1uZ1_LCK8Kx0cZRVyarBrAA&amp;utm_content=242338171&amp;utm_source=hs_email\">which will take place on the 14 of February 2023 (from 9:00 a.m.) in one of the most beautiful European cities<\/a>, you can look forward to lectures on the applications of Raman spectroscopy in the following areas:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"cs\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Inorganic and organic chemistry, solid state, catalysis<\/span><\/span> <\/span><\/li>\n<li><span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"cs\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Polymers and microplastics<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Pharmaceuticals: proliferation of small drugs and NPs<\/span><\/span> <\/span><\/li>\n<li><span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"cs\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Biopharmaceuticals: Purification and characterization of EVs<\/span><\/span> <\/span><\/li>\n<li><span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"cs\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Characterization of biological tissues<\/span><\/span> <\/span><\/li>\n<li><span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"cs\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Bioprocesses and PAT: upstream downstream process monitoring<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>In addition, you can also learn about <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/raman\/timegate\/\">Timegate spectrometers<\/a><\/strong> and try them out. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.abcs.it\/it\/blog\/timegated-raman\/timegated-tg-raman-technology?utm_campaign=Newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsmi=242338171&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-9LZmgQRAgvpfclNPgM6dXdrtGZzGKz7chucjaYyvDSJjW-HB488-WghNtRmZ66Yyk4OHgfprdB8-uOV7XJLG9WUM8dOg&amp;utm_content=242338171&amp;utm_source=hs_email\">You can register here<\/a> and the seminar is free.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dear customers! As the first novelty of this year we would like to present to you a seminar of the Finnish company Timegate, which we are newly representing in the Czech Republic. This emerging company supplies both scientific and industry Raman spectrometers, the first integrated systems with really suppressed fluorescence. At the seminar, which will [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":11263,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[123,33],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-11304","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-123","category-news"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Valentine Spectroscopy